<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">In many ways the role as the new fall guy =
for Big Sir Jim/the Tampa Bay Glazers (delete as per owner-shambles prefere=
nce) will suit Mauricio Pochettino if he is <a href=3D"https://ablink.edito=
rial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBg=
