0077B6;">given the Manchester United job</a>. He has a reputation as an und=
erdog. A man who has taken on the challenges of managing upstart PSG, tough=
-times-make-tough-people Chelsea and most recently the soccer team of the m=
ost powerful nation on earth, is used to working with his hands tied behind=
 his back (albeit presumably resting on the significant wedge in a nearby p=
ocket).</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">There are at least some transferable skill=
s Pochettino can bring with him from the USA USA USA: extracting performanc=
es from creaking defenders; managing the expectations of a fanbase with out=
sized ambitions given the quality of talent available for selection; and wo=
rking in an environment where an egotistical billionaire is known for makin=
